# Fixes what graphify indexes, so every rebuild — here, in CI, in a fresh clone —
# produces the same graph. `graphify update` has no `--code-only` flag and the scope
# `extract --code-only` used lives in an untracked cache, so the scope has to be
# committed here instead.
#
# Prose and images: not code, and the image path wants an LLM.
*.md
*.pdf
*.png
*.svg

# YAML config: workflows, mkdocs and the commit-check config contributed a third of
# the survey graph (258 nodes from .github/workflows alone) as bare mapping keys.
*.yml
*.yaml
